Apk size

 flutter build apk --split-per-abi

app-arm64-v8a-release.apk	✅ Most modern Android devices (64-bit)	Newer phones (2020+) like Samsung, OnePlus, Google Pixel
app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk	✅ Older 32-bit Android devices	Older phones (pre-2020) like low-end or budget Android devices
app-x86_64-release.apk	❌ Not for mobile (for emulators/Chromebooks)	Android emulators or some x86-based tablets


