  jis trah se mai repo and repo impl and use case bloc event and state use krke api implement kiya hu , aur base rul appp_constant se liya hu
  waise hi artecture follow krke ye api call kro

  daily ka api call hoga day wale p[e click krke

  weekly and titihi ke time call hoga
  select krne ke baad jab user bottom dialog ko close krega tb

  model class bhi wasie hi bnana hai jaise mai baki ke liye bnaaya hu freezed use krke
